      "content": "I'm sorry, I think there might have been some weird autocorrect errors or something in your response? You kept using words like \"gobble\" and \"goblin\" in relation to the cash and the data feeds. \n\nCould you please re-explain those exact same mechanics—the settlement timing mismatches and the data feed latencies—but without those terms? I need to make sure I have the professional, technical terminology correct for my notes.",
